# money_manager

Before changing `lib/` or `test/`, read `.cursor/skills/account-book/SKILL.md` and `DESIGN.md`. Those two files are the contract.

`DESIGN.md` decides colors, type, motion, sheets, and navigation. Do not reseed a `ColorScheme` or add another theme.

After changing `lib/` or `test/`, run `flutter test` and finish only after it passes.
